/v1/","context":{"app_id":4202540,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4202540","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:04Z","value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4882470","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4202540-1846651706683274","game_id":"steam-4202540","kind":"announcement","title":"Some prologue changes","summary":"Listening to your feedback, we've decided to make some changes: - Crucifix no longer has charges, it breaks after purging the demon - so no worry that it will become useless mid-exorcism- Demon in Prologue, due to a small exorcism arena is no longe going invisible - you will be able to track him constantly while far from walls- As Crucifix and Demon changes give you some advantage, the Demon itself is way much faster in movement and his attacks- Crucifix closeup camera provides more vision (is j","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:21:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4202540-1843481262692890","game_id":"steam-4202540","kind":"update","title":"Small Prologue update","summary":"🚧 🛠️ DEMO BUILD UPDATE 🛠️🚧 Even if we mainly focus on the post-demo content now, some changes and features apply to our prologue too 🙂 Apart from endless bugfixing and optimization nerding:AI is more fluent in attacking in combatthanks to the above improvements, Dagger Cultist no longer attempts to not-fair attacks in between parrying statebetter watch where you step - especially in some dark places :>stealth crit attack only available while crouchingtorches dont stack so you cant have them in r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T16:57:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4202540-1839041357036466","game_id":"steam-4202540","kind":"update","title":"Demo combat-focused update","summary":"DEMO BUILD UPDATE We've pushed a demo update with kind of strong rework over the whole dynamic of combat + many QoLs and bug fixes. I hope the feeling of the game (combat especially) has improved for you guys - but to be sure if we move to the right direction, we need your opinions :) Would be best if you could leave even a short \"its better!\" or \"it sucks even more!\" - best, on Discrod channel of the game :) Hope you guys gonna like the changes and improvements! Cheers! Kiwi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T18:22:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4202540-1837955055364466","game_id":"steam-4202540","kind":"update","title":"Build Update: DLSS","summary":"- DLSS feature added to the project- minor GPU quality improvements on lights","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T21:01:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4202540-1837955055360073","game_id":"steam-4202540","kind":"update","title":"Performance update","summary":"DEMO BUILD UPDATE - lots of performance upgrades- much lower GPU requirements on High/Med/Low settings- master Graphics setting in Video Settings that will help with generalized profile- fix for a bug when sometimes item could go dark after moving to chest- items are now not hidden once they are discovered- grenade got some visual feedback love- idle camera shake removed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-11T21:39:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360073","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4202540-1836506165575631","game_id":"steam-4202540","kind":"announcement","title":"Anhedonia Demo is Live now!","summary":"Dear Exorcists! We are happy to announce that you can now play the demo version of Anhedonia: Sanctuary of Ash. We look forward to your feedback and ideas via the surveys: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1dtdl4eqklz-T0qLHRzkaF2k00uMJhUKm7o6tZSgX8pc/edit or on our official Discord: DISCROD Have fun! Kiwi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T10:15:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165575631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4202540-1835871199315710","game_id":"steam-4202540","kind":"announcement","title":"Public Demo version coming on July 6, 2026!","summary":"The public demo of the game will be released on July 6, 2026! The Anhedonia demo serves as a prologue, allowing you to get acquainted with the game's mechanics and soak up the atmosphere of its world. We want to hear your feedback! We are open to all suggestions and ideas—and especially to constructive criticism.We would really like to know what you enjoy most and what needs further work.What—or whom—would you like to encounter on Edgar’s journey? What weapons would you like to wield, or what ac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T14:19:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199315710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4202540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4202540":"2026-10-26T01:48:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4202540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4882470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4202540","app_id":4202540,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"116c55f147f93869a354f010a0bfe39b4567c00891c09e06e6d5625d8a647ec8","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A third-person medieval dark fantasy adventure RPG with survival horror elements. As Edgar, a former priest with a fractured memory, explore a ruined world, solve environmental puzzles and uncover its secrets. Face twisted creatures and perform exorcisms to free the possessed.","publishers":[{"name":"Trauma Bonded Studio","creator_clan_account_id":45866723}],"developers":[{"name":"Trauma Bonded Studio","creator_clan_account_id":45866723}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1830240000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Anhedonia – Sanctuary of Ash Official Trailer",